# cardrop device list
#
# One line per device:
#
#     VOLUME NAME | FOLDER ON DEVICE | DESTINATION
#
#   VOLUME NAME   The device's name as shown in Finder when it's plugged in (as under /Volumes).
#   FOLDER        The folder to upload, usually DCIM. Use . for the whole device.
#   DESTINATION   An rclone remote and folder, e.g.  gdrive:Camera uploads
#
# Files are only ever added to the destination. Nothing there is deleted or overwritten,
# so you can safely clear the device after the "✅ upload verified" notification.
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Examples (remove the # to use one):
#
# Insta360 X5  | DCIM | gdrive:Insta360
# GoPro        | DCIM | gdrive:GoPro
# DJI Mini 4   | DCIM | gdrive:Drone footage
# Untitled     | .    | gdrive:SD card dumps
